    // Time t
    subgraph cluster_t {
        label="Time t";
        fontname="Helvetica-Bold";
        fontsize=13;
        fontcolor="#1A1A2E";
        style="rounded,filled";
        fillcolor="#F7F9FC";
        color="#B8C4D9";
        penwidth=1.4;
        margin=16;

        Pos_t [label=<Pos<SUB>t</SUB>>, shape=ellipse, fillcolor="#A9DDB0", color="#4F9A5C"];
        Action_t [label=<Action<SUB>t</SUB>>, shape=box, style="rounded,filled", fillcolor="#FFC98A", color="#D98E2B"];
        Reward_t [label=<Reward<SUB>t</SUB>>, shape=diamond, fillcolor="#9CC4F2", color="#1565C0"];

        Pos_t -> Action_t;
        Pos_t -> Reward_t;
        Action_t -> Reward_t;
    }

    // Time t+1
    subgraph cluster_t1 {
        label="Time t+1";
        fontname="Helvetica-Bold";
        fontsize=13;
        fontcolor="#1A1A2E";
        style="rounded,filled";
        fillcolor="#F7F9FC";
        color="#B8C4D9";
        penwidth=1.4;
        margin=16;

        Pos_t1 [label=<Pos<SUB>t+1</SUB>>, shape=ellipse, fillcolor="#A9DDB0", color="#4F9A5C"];
    }

    // Temporal connections
    Action_t -> Pos_t1 [penwidth=1.8];
    Pos_t -> Pos_t1 [penwidth=1.8];
    Pos_t1 -> Reward_t;
}
```
::::
:::

- **State variables**:
  - $Pos_t$: agent's grid position $(x, y)$ at time $t$
- **Decision variable**:
  - $Action_t$: movement direction (Up, Down, Left, Right)
- **Chance nodes** (transition):
  - $Pos_{t+1}$: next position after action (stochastic due to slippery
    surface; Pr(intended action) = 0.8)
- **Utility node**:
  - $Reward_t$: derived from $Pos_{t+1}$ (e.g., -0.04 per step, +1/-1 at terminal states)

* Dynamic Decision Networks: Tetris Example

