  rewards
- **State variables**:
  - $Board_t$: grid configuration at time $t$
  - $Piece_t$: current piece falling
  - $NextPiece_t$: upcoming piece
- **Decision variable**:
  - $Action_t$: placement of $Piece_t$ (rotation and position)
